gnome battle ward~
a gnome battle-ward~
This gnome is riding inside a huge wooden machine.
~
This gnome is riding inside some sort of walking machine. Inside it he stands
almost ten feet tall and the ground shakes slightly as he lumbers past. A huge
engine rides at the back, pumping out hot steam and numerous power crystals
seem to send this energy into the mechanized body. What a wondrous display of
technology.
~
