a rebel ranger~
This tall ghoul looks to have been out in the wilds.
~
This ghoul must have been out inside the wilds for months. Their clothes are
ragged, torn, and caked in dirt and mud. Judging by the amount of dried blood
on their weapons, they had some success harassing the imperial patrols and
scouts that are sent. The odd symbol of two circles intertwined on their boots
must mark them part of the Alliance.
~
