rebel soldier~
a rebel soldier~
This alliance soldier is helping to keep this city free.
~
This man is not a gnome, dwarf, ghoul, or elf but rather a soldier of the
alliance. He has pledged his life to defend one of the last free cities within
a thousand leagues of the city of Bazabel.  By the way the other soldiers and
rangers bow their heads to him, he is an equal to them and they are equals to
him.
~
