~
This machine is even more impressive than a battle-ward. It stands twenty feet
tall and must weight more than three ogres.  The solid metal frame looks like
it could withstand any blow and the two massive arms could crush steel like
dirt. The steam engine and numerous magikal devices must keep it balanced and
power it's heavy movements. A large device that is constantly leaking fire is
mounted on one arm.
~
