8 0 1048577
0 0 0 0
1 0 0
E
book account~
In service of Kelra IronShield, I dictate the fall of our people.

650 AC (Adamantite Age)
   The city of Bazabel, supported by their half-troll/orc/ogre slaves, launch
their first attack against the Fortress of Mount Sorrow. The attack is
repelled but at great cost to our numbers.

705 AC
Under General Zavish, the Imperial army marches against our Mountain Keep
Due to heavy storms the repairs had been slow, the fortress is taken.  Only
the few children studying there made it home.

0 RE  (Rebirth era)
General Zavish returns again to plague our people. His army breaches
the doors of our great mine city.  If not for our Gnome Kin under Dilandou,
as well as the Ghoul alliance to the north, our people would have been buried
inside that mountain. General Zavish is killed at the cost our most benevolent
King Inthas IronShield and his son, Mithras.  Our city is in ruins. We flee to
the great city of Kinterownt.

25 RE
General and Despot Zanzen takes up his father's ambition. He launches an
attack upon Kinterownt using our once great Fortress as a launching point.
The Battle-Wards and Ethernaught's are first deployed into a real warfare
situation. Zanzen retreats after seven months of seige.

35 RE
 Zanzen and his forces wage war on the other side of the world against a
great city state known only as Alden. We begin preparation to form an
army and retake our great city.

45 RE
Talks among our most beloved Queen, Lord Dilandou, the Alliance Council
end. It is decided that we keep our people inside Kinterownt for no less
than four generations to bolster our numbers and prevent our great race
from leaving this world.
~
